 style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 22,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/09 a 31\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">4\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 27,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/01 a 14\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 9K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 14 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/08 a 02\/08\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 18,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (03\/08 a 31\/08\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 20,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/09 a 31\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">4\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 25,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/01 a 14\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Povoa\u00e7\u00e3o Trail 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 7\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo, 14 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, com centro nevr\u00e1lgico no concelho da Povoa\u00e7\u00e3o, na Ilha de S\u00e3o Miguel, Regi\u00e3o Aut\u00f3noma dos A\u00e7ores.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e altimetrias dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento disponibiliza a Povoa\u00e7\u00e3o Ultra 50K (+3600m D+), Povoa\u00e7\u00e3o Trail 30K (+2450m D+), Povoa\u00e7\u00e3o Sprint 18K (+1000m D+), Mini Trail 9K (+300m D+) e Caminhada de 9 km (+300m D+).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde se localizam as partidas de cada prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As partidas da Ultra 50K (07h45) e Trail 30K (08h30) realizam-se no Jardim Municipal da Povoa\u00e7\u00e3o. As provas de Trail Sprint 18K (09h50), Mini Trail e Caminhada (10h00) partem de Nossa Senhora dos Rem\u00e9dios, com transfer em autocarro assegurado pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o a partir das 08h45 na Vila da Povoa\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o hor\u00e1rio e local do check-in e secretariado?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O check-in presencial realiza-se no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal da Povoa\u00e7\u00e3o no s\u00e1bado (13 de mar\u00e7o) entre as 14h00 e as 19h00, e no domingo (14 de mar\u00e7o) das 06h00 \u00e0s 08h00 (at\u00e9 \u00e0s 07h30 para os atletas da Ultra 50K).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os limites de tempo de cada dist\u00e2ncia?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A barreira hor\u00e1ria m\u00e1xima \u00e9 de 11 horas para a Ultra 50K, 7h30 para o Trail 30K e 5 horas para o Trail Sprint 18K. O Mini Trail e a Caminhada n\u00e3o possuem barreiras hor\u00e1rias restritivas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que material est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo no kit de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e que pr\u00e9mios existem?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui peitoral com chip integrado, brinde\/prenda oficial, guia digital do atleta, transporte para as partidas de N\u00aa Sra. dos Rem\u00e9dios, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, e medalha de finisher para todos os que concluam a sua dist\u00e2ncia.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Povoa\u00e7\u00e3o Trail 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-03-14\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Povoa\u00e7\u00e3o, A\u00e7ores\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Povoa\u00e7\u00e3o\", \"addressRegion\": \"A\u00e7ores\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/