il e a Caminhada n\u00e3o possuem barreiras hor\u00e1rias restritivas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Que material est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo no kit de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e que pr\u00e9mios existem?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui peitoral com chip integrado, brinde\/prenda oficial, guia digital do atleta, transporte para as partidas de N\u00aa Sra. dos Rem\u00e9dios, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, e medalha de finisher para todos os que concluam a sua dist\u00e2ncia.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":67486,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498,499],"event_type_2":[104,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-67485","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-povoacaoacores","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type-trail-ultra","event_type_2-acores","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/cartaz-povoacao-trail.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/67485","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=67485"}],"version-history":[{"count":4,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/67485\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":68713,"href":"https